{20}{Well, I used to be on the City Council in Latveria, until 'Lord' Doom decided to relieve me of my position. [he sounds a bit upset]}{Well, I used to be on the City Council in Latveria, until 'Lord' Doom decided to 'relieve me' of my position. [he sounds a bit upset]}{}{}{}{}
