{30}{I figured out what he and the other members of the council were planning and I spoke to them about it.  I told them it wasn't right and they needed to rethink their position.  They didn't want to hear it.}{I figured out what he and the other members of the council were planning and I spoke to them about it.  I told them it wasn't right and they needed to rethink their position.  They didn't want to hear it.}{}{}{}{}
