{50}{Lord Doom feels that magic is an abomination in the land.  The only reason it has been allowed to exist, according to him, is because there has been nothing as powerful to challenge its dominance.  Until now.  With the technological revolution comes the means by which magic will meet its end.  At least that is what Doom and the council think.}{Lord Doom feels that magic is an abomination in the land.  The only reason it has been allowed to exist, according to him, is because there has been nothing as powerful to challenge its dominance.  Until now.  With the technological revolution comes the means by which magic will meet its end.  At least that is what Doom and the council think.}{}{}{}{}
{51}{What can be done about this?}{}{5}{}{80}{}
{52}{Good.  Technology is the superior force and it should rule the day.}{}{5}{}{90}{}
{59}{E:}{}{1}{}{0}{}

{60}{I couldn't agree with you more.}{I couldn't agree with you more.}{}{}{}{}
