{110}{She is ... was my fiancee.  [he becomes quiet for a moment.  then he begins to speak again]  Ever since Doom exiled me I have been unable to contact her.  I have no idea how she is doing and it is killing me.  I've written her a note but I have no way to deliver it.  If I attempt to enter the city the guards have been ordered to kill me on sight.}{She is ... was my fiancee.  [he becomes quiet for a moment.  then he begins to speak again]  Ever since Doom exiled me I have been unable to contact her.  I have no idea how she is doing and it is killing me.  I've written her a note but I have no way to deliver it.  If I attempt to enter the city the guards have been ordered to kill me on sight.}{}{}{}{}
