{180}{That monster!!  When I get my hands on him ... !! [he is enraged for a few seconds, and then becomes calm enough to speak]  Doom knows that before he exiled me I was working on a new suit of armour that could withstand more damage than anything previously seen in Arcanum.  I'm sure he was trying to get information about it.  My poor Maria didn't know anything.  I never thought he would do something so vile and so heinous!!}{That monster!!  When I get my hands on him ... !! [he is enraged for a few seconds, and then becomes calm enough to speak]  Doom knows that before he exiled me I was working on a new suit of armour that could withstand more damage than anything previously seen in Arcanum.  I'm sure he was trying to get information about it.  My poor Maria didn't know anything.  I never thought he would do something so vile and so heinous!!}{}{}{}{}
